{"4940980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Ramen Bar", "steam_appid": 4940980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/3d464623b8a2332a1f76f1984763f6e0.webp?t=1787768331\" width=580 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/c49fb5fc656be5254ba7d3667295f267.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/c49fb5fc656be5254ba7d3667295f267.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/c49fb5fc656be5254ba7d3667295f267.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>After the mysterious death of your grandma, you inherit her ramen shop and the responsibility of carrying on the family business. But as you settle into your new life, you begin to uncover secrets surrounding her death.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/5912a33cd4b177605621ed5a706c3e35.webp?t=1787768331\" width=700 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/a0310a034210ecf2fe8709da6f702daa.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/a0310a034210ecf2fe8709da6f702daa.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/a0310a034210ecf2fe8709da6f702daa.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Swing the knife yourself and complete various minigames to make the perfect ramen bowl.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/29e3f22c57e4366f0d4cea27893f8d6e.webp?t=1787768331\" width=700 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/0187706f171d36fc8de537fe5993ace6.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/0187706f171d36fc8de537fe5993ace6.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/0187706f171d36fc8de537fe5993ace6.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Clean up after every shift, scrub away the mess and watch the bar shine again.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/a1a0b96bec0729a9a96416795bd3ae23.webp?t=1787768331\" width=700 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/920eeb4e2f7a12a9e578089d5988062c.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/920eeb4e2f7a12a9e578089d5988062c.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/920eeb4e2f7a12a9e578089d5988062c.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Complete orders, take payment and hand back the change, one customer at a time.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/b31d27a0bf9dd40ad17076891857c407.webp?t=1787768331\" width=700 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/55c4c8a763bbf342fa7fc886740b7a23.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/55c4c8a763bbf342fa7fc886740b7a23.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/55c4c8a763bbf342fa7fc886740b7a23.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Bowls slip, glass shatters, physics doesn't forgive.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/7d026129c6ff7ec9a3dca9d7e0358e7c.webp?t=1787768331\" width=700 height=45 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/288f5af4ceda13e1e3c5894b9448dc8c.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/288f5af4ceda13e1e3c5894b9448dc8c.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/288f5af4ceda13e1e3c5894b9448dc8c.mp4?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>But when you're all by yourself... she's always watching you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Endless Mode strips away the horror entirely — pure gameplay, no jumpscares.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Cooking:</strong> Swing a real knife to slice ingredients and complete various minigames to season your bowl and make the perfect ramen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift-by-Shift Progression:</strong> Expand your menu and restock ingredients as the days pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Customer Interactions:</strong> Talk to customers, take orders, handle payment, and return change.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Cleanup:</strong> Procedurally clean the bar after every shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breakable Environment:</strong> Bowls, plates, bottles and ingredients shatter realistically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunted Bar:</strong> An onryō watches from the shadows, when you're most vulnerable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> All the ramen bar experience, none of the scares.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/3d464623b8a2332a1f76f1984763f6e0.webp?t=1787768331\" width=580 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/c49fb5fc656be5254ba7d3667295f267.poster.avif?t=1787768331\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940980/extras/c49fb5fc656be5254ba7d3667295f267.webm?t=1787768331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src